                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17fb1893-d422-4fb7-b33c-cc8a00882aba",
                                                "sense_id": "f58e4ccb-7a45-31b6-963d-be6eac627e4b",
                                                "text": "critical and collective reason"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "collective",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbcc3c76-6489-31ea-82da-423ba6dfce43",
                                        "entry_id": "664003ac-66de-305b-bdd6-0664ea048220",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A farm owned by a collection of people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "016c6c65-29cf-3d84-b8dc-a61d83111c79",
                                        "entry_id": "664003ac-66de-305b-bdd6-0664ea048220",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of more farms managed and owned, through the state, by the community."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28b37000-6ec5-36b5-9710-83db273fb9d6",
                                        "entry_id": "664003ac-66de-305b-bdd6-0664ea048220",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A collective noun or name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a75bfde7-80bf-3374-819f-cab1a8f17424",
                                        "entry_id": "664003ac-66de-305b-bdd6-0664ea048220",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group dedicated to a particular cause or interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a83bbd3c-d1c1-4ff9-9802-419af54a8e0d",
                                                "sense_id": "a75bfde7-80bf-3374-819f-cab1a8f17424",
                                                "text": "Critical Art Ensemble is one of many art collectives operating on the principle that information is power and that it is most effectively made available through a combination of science and aesthetics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dcbbea9-a975-4c26-997f-b789aafe227a",
                                                "sense_id": "a75bfde7-80bf-3374-819f-cab1a8f17424",
                                                "text": "There are, however, a number of contemporary artists and art collectives that have defined their practice precisely around the facilitation of dialogue among diverse communities."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc3577d4-268b-4f57-a2d9-bed2984b9bc6",
                                                "sense_id": "a75bfde7-80bf-3374-819f-cab1a8f17424",
                                                "text": "Today’s collectives create together, tour together, exhibit together, live together, survive together, eat together, sleep together, march together, fight together and party together, too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "515a3298-50ec-34a6-8b38-cb92becf97f0",
                                        "entry_id": "664003ac-66de-305b-bdd6-0664ea048220",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The flight control used to control a helicopter's ascent or descent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3fef912-f622-49e5-bc2e-fccb5bd734bc",
                                                "sense_id": "515a3298-50ec-34a6-8b38-cb92becf97f0",
                                                "text": "A pilot normally holds the collective stationary until the helicopter stops; however, to get more braking action, lower the collective slightly. Keep in mind that, due to the increased ground friction when the collective is lowered or[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f45a375-d5a7-4232-a20a-01ebbbc73fed",
                                                "sense_id": "515a3298-50ec-34a6-8b38-cb92becf97f0",
                                                "text": "Hover height, rate of ascent, and the rate of descent are controlled by using the collective. Helicopter position and the direction of travel are controlled by the cyclic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bff6680-46f1-4a68-914e-179813894ddf",
                        "source_entry_id": "df14920a-35cb-39b3-96b4-f3a38432ac42",
                        "source_sense_id": "67ea700e-4782-3f27-bb73-6e504e3d2c53",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kollektiv",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kollektiv",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab5a12ee-6b7a-30d7-95c3-99e3ec2e4098",
                                        "entry_id": "b72cc887-3c11-3193-b6ab-13d088fd0101",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "soziales Gebilde, dessen Mitglieder unter einem Gesichtspunkt zusammengefasst werden können"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Soziologie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f06ec863-bac7-4786-8f17-2468e304c3a9",
                                                "sense_id": "ab5a12ee-6b7a-30d7-95c3-99e3ec2e4098",
                                                "text": "„Die Verpflichtung des Werktätigen, sich vor dem Kollektiv zu entschuldigen, wird bestätigt, [sic!] oder ihm wird eine solche Pflicht auferlegt.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4316d7c-08e9-45b2-a46c-377955abd3fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "df14920a-35cb-39b3-96b4-f3a38432ac42",
                        "source_sense_id": "67ea700e-4782-3f27-bb73-6e504e3d2c53",
                        "target_lang_word": "Arbeitsgemeinschaft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Arbeitsgemeinschaft",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0b8205f-5966-39b1-8901-d2ddb9e17865",
                                        "entry_id": "d3324060-6cd2-3655-85ca-4218b0cde5bc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gruppe von Personen, die zur gemeinsamen Arbeit zusammenkommen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "937fe2b2-ee4f-446d-a200-4623475785dd",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b8205f-5966-39b1-8901-d2ddb9e17865",
                                                "text": "Die Arbeitsgemeinschaft, die sich mit der Qualitätssicherung beschäftigt, wird sich jeden Montag treffen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f46de07c-a997-4676-a579-dcaf2d270e72",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b8205f-5966-39b1-8901-d2ddb9e17865",
                                                "text": "„Für den gleichen Tatbestand war auch die Einstellung der Schüler zur Unterrichtsmethodik typisch: Sie sprachen sich in großer Mehrheit für eine mehr traditionelle Form des Fachunterrichts aus, in dem der Lehrer als unterrichtende Fachkraft auftritt, und waren überwiegend gegen Arbeitsgemeinschaften und freiere Formen des Unterrichtens.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53fff160-834d-4359-835c-1502d6bdc8fb",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b8205f-5966-39b1-8901-d2ddb9e17865",
                                                "text": "„Leo kannte sogar Marie von irgendwelchen Arbeitsgemeinschaften her, wo katholische und evangelische Jugendliche über Demokratie und über konfessionelle Toleranz diskutierten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17984626-0847-4fae-a93d-5345ad1db742",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b8205f-5966-39b1-8901-d2ddb9e17865",
                                                "text": "„In den Arbeitsgemeinschaften beteiligt sich Volz als Prädikatskandidat ganz außerordentlich lebhaft.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f0b2f60c-3e90-4f46-bd6b-3e9b2197265f",
                        "source_entry_id": "df14920a-35cb-39b3-96b4-f3a38432ac42",
                        "source_sense_id": "67ea700e-4782-3f27-bb73-6e504e3d2c53",
                        "target_lang_word": "коллекти́в",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "коллекти́в",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4952c590-38e2-3c70-bf43-0b0f15dbafaf",
                                        "entry_id": "dde55d24-b350-33a4-b493-2018973d30ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "группа людей, объединённых общей деятельностью"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d090764-c9ef-4978-a29a-1508a1c2c4b6",
                                                "sense_id": "4952c590-38e2-3c70-bf43-0b0f15dbafaf",
                                                "text": "Дружный коллектив нашего класса отправился в поход."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bb93ccf-18d3-4bdc-9bb8-bc6d744eb7dc",
                                                "sense_id": "4952c590-38e2-3c70-bf43-0b0f15dbafaf",
                                                "text": "— Удалось повидать совхоз. Грандиозно. Зерновая фабрика! Вы себе не представляете, голубчик, что такое пятилетка, что такое воля коллектива!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eebac9d-2198-3445-b207-a9c834925de2",
                                        "entry_id": "dde55d24-b350-33a4-b493-2018973d30ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "опт. линза, обращённая к объективу"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dbf3de1-faa7-457b-9e36-4d79a19f2747",
                                                "sense_id": "1eebac9d-2198-3445-b207-a9c834925de2",
                                                "text": "За плёнкой помещается коллектив и проекционный объектив; коллектив устанавливается в непосредственной близости от плёнки с тем, чтобы захватывать весь световой поток, проходящий через плёнку."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
